      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you refresh my memory on why mIsRunning isn\u0027t strictly a function of the current state and the current message being processed (as in, what case requires it to be tracked separately/explicitly)? I ask because it\u0027s kind of error-prone, so I\u0027d like to see if there\u0027s a cleaner way, and we probably talked about this but I have forgotten (so it\u0027s not super obvious).",
